@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who stay longer. Rentals of 3 or more days should cost less than their full price.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A rental covering 3 or more days costs 10% less than its full price (daily price times days).
+- Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+- `quote` and `book` both return the reduced total; a booking's total still equals the quote.
+- The discounted total is rounded to the nearest euro cent (halves round up), so it stays an integer.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+- `equipment-rental`: the Quote requirement now applies a 10% long-stay discount; Booking and Money-as-integer-cents scenarios follow.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/rental.ts` (pricing), `src/rental.test.ts`, and the README rental section.
+- No API shape change: `Quote` and `Booking` keep the same fields.
